{
  "uid": "mereka-lms-logs",
  "title": "Mereka LMS - Logs",
  "description": "Cluster-Loki view of nonprod LMS error classes, dependency failures, and drilldown logs.",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "mereka-lms",
    "logs",
    "applications",
    "loki",
    "nonprod"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "LMS Monitoring-as-Code",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/mereka-lms/blob/main/infrastructure/monitoring/README.md"
    },
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Source Logging Metrics",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/mereka-lms/tree/main/infrastructure/monitoring/logging-metrics"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope and Signal Model",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Mereka LMS logs\n\nThis board translates app-owned LMS log-metric contracts into canonical Grafana using **cluster Loki**.\n\n| Scope | Selector |\n|---|---|\n| LMS runtime logs | `{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"}` |\n| Primary LMS pods | `app.kubernetes.io/name=\"lms\"` |\n| Error classes | `HTTP 5xx`, auth failures, MySQL errors, Redis errors, stateful storage failures |\n\nUse this board for error spikes and dependency regressions. Routine request logs are intentionally not surfaced here."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP 5xx (24h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"} |~ \"(HTTP/1\\\\.1 5[0-9]{2}|\\\"status\\\":5[0-9]{2}|\\\"status_code\\\":5[0-9]{2})\" [24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Auth Failures (24h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"} |~ \"(?i)(login_session|authentication|login_failed)\" |~ \"(HTTP/1\\\\.1 401|HTTP/1\\\\.1 403|HTTP/1\\\\.1 500|\\\"status\\\":4[0-9]{2}|\\\"status_code\\\":4[0-9]{2}|\\\"status\\\":500|\\\"status_code\\\":500)\" [24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
